  <name>CAERPObjects</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>PA2 and EM2 objects </value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>اشیای PA2 و EM2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Oggetti КА2, УП2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Obiekty КА2, УП2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Объекты КА2, УП2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>PA2, İY2 nesneleri</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Đối tượng KA2, UP2</value>
  </synonym>
  <explanation>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Technological subsystem.
It includes objects which belong only to the PA2 and EM2 configurations.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>زیرسیستم فناوری.
شامل اشیایی است که فقط به پیکربندی‌های PA2 و EM2 تعلق دارند.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Sottosistema tecnologico.
Include gli oggetti che appartengono solo alle configurazioni КА2, УП2.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Podsystem technologiczny. 
 Zawiera obiekty, związane tylko z konfiguracjami КА2, УП2.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Технологическая подсистема.
Включает в себя объекты, относящиеся только к конфигурациям КА2, УП2.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Teknolojik alt sistem.
Sadece PA2, EM2 konfigürasyonlarıyla ilgili nesneleri içerir.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Phân hệ công nghệ.
Bao gồm các đối tượng chỉ liên quan đến cấu hình KA2, UP2.</value>
  </explanation>
